  steps:
  - target: {fileID: 1086800736}
    portraitTarget: {fileID: 0}
    title: THIS IS YOUR MODEL
    body: Every AI product starts as a model - something that turns input into output.
      Tap SHIP IT to ship your first one.
    waitForRealAction: 1
  - target: {fileID: 1393961391}
    portraitTarget: {fileID: 0}
    title: TRACK YOUR GROWTH
    body: Headcount, burn rate, your multiplier - everything that keeps the lights
      on lives here.
    waitForRealAction: 0
  - target: {fileID: 1133487724}
    portraitTarget: {fileID: 0}
    title: BUILD YOUR TEAM
    body: Hire engineers here. More headcount means more compute - the resource every
      model is hungry for.
    waitForRealAction: 0
  - target: {fileID: 698833969}
    portraitTarget: {fileID: 0}
    title: MODELS GET SMARTER
    body: 'Keep growing revenue - your model levels up with it. First stop: the Transformer,
      at $2,500 revenue.'
    waitForRealAction: 0
